sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthController
    participant AuthService
    participant PasswordEncoder
    participant UserRepository
    participant JwtTokenProvider
    participant RefreshTokenRepository
    participant Database

    Client->>AuthController: POST /api/v1/auth/login<br/>{email, password}
    AuthController->>AuthService: login(LoginRequest)
    AuthService->>UserRepository: findByEmail(email)
    UserRepository->>Database: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    Database-->>UserRepository: Optional<User>
    UserRepository-->>AuthService: User or empty

    alt User not found
        AuthService-->>AuthController: throw BusinessException("Invalid email or password")
        AuthController-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

    AuthService->>PasswordEncoder: matches(password, user.passwordHash)
    PasswordEncoder-->>AuthService: boolean

    alt Password does not match
        AuthService-->>AuthController: throw BusinessException("Invalid email or password")
        AuthController-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

    alt Email not verified
        AuthService-->>AuthController: throw BusinessException("Please verify your email before logging in")
        AuthController-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

    Note right of AuthService: Update last seen timestamp

    AuthService->>UserRepository: save(User)
    UserRepository->>Database: UPDATE users SET updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
    Database-->>UserRepository: OK
    UserRepository-->>AuthService: updated User

    Note right of AuthService: Generate token pair

    AuthService->>JwtTokenProvider: generateAccessToken(userId, email, role)
    JwtTokenProvider-->>AuthService: JWT access token (15min expiry)

    AuthService->>JwtTokenProvider: generateRefreshToken(userId)
    JwtTokenProvider-->>AuthService: JWT refresh token (7 days expiry)

    AuthService->>RefreshTokenRepository: save(RefreshToken)
    RefreshTokenRepository->>Database: INSERT INTO refresh_tokens (user_id, token, expires_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?)
    Database-->>RefreshTokenRepository: RefreshToken
    RefreshTokenRepository-->>AuthService: saved RefreshToken

    AuthService-->>AuthController: AuthResponse(accessToken, refreshToken, user)
    AuthController-->>Client: 200 OK<br/>{message: "Login successful", data: {accessToken, refreshToken, user}}
